    "No database migration, production configuration, frontend, trajectory worker, cloud desktop identity, browser login/profile or cloud purchases changed.",
    "Read-only production browser probe, exact-client binding, capture and private OSS transfer were verified; no actual content publishing was replayed.",
    "Legacy optional display-guard install skipped without root; desktop helper refresh remains under UID 997. Existing system helpers and legacy screenshot hashes remain preserved in backups.",
    "Private transfer objects, source branch, old images, original scripts/screenshots, configuration and database backups retained."
